{"id":"624546","name":"茴香虾皮鸡蛋包子","author":"雨中漫步li","authorId":"10274398","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/624546/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"茴香","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"400克"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母","amount":"4克"},{"name":"40°温水","amount":"200克"},{"name":"虾皮","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"二个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"虾皮洗净。","img":"images/624546/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡蛋炒熟。","img":"images/624546/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"茴香洗净切好，放姜末。","img":"images/624546/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"所有食材放在一起，放芝麻油、盐。","img":"images/624546/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"拌匀备用。","img":"images/624546/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"厨师机合面。","img":"images/624546/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"醒发好，揉面排气。","img":"images/624546/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"分成50克一个的剂子。","img":"images/624546/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"擀成包子皮。","img":"images/624546/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入馅料，收口。","img":"images/624546/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"全部包好，二次醒发30分钟《室内温度22°》。","img":"images/624546/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"冷水上锅，大火烧开转中火烧17分钟。","img":"images/624546/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"关火焖5分钟。","img":"images/624546/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"煊软大包子，出锅喽。","img":"images/624546/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"太香了。","img":"images/624546/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}